  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strategic Communication of EU Delegation to Timor-Leste</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;2.1.Overall objective&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The Overall Objective (Impact) of this contract is to position the EU as a partner of reference for Timor-Leste among selected target audiences.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;2.2.Specific objective(s)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The Specific Objective (Outcome) is the following:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&#xbf;To measurably increase awareness, understanding and perception of the EU priorities, in particular Global Gateway.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;2.3.Expected outputs to be achieved by the contractor&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The expected outputs of this contract are as follows:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;1.1Large-scale public campaigns are designed and implemented to raise awareness, understanding and perception of the EU&#xbf;s partnership with the country among selected target audiences.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;1.2Impact-focused case studies and best practices, particularly demonstrated through engaging human interest stories, from priority EU support projects are identified and promoted as example of success/role model in the social and economic development of Timor-Leste.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
